WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:11.338
A normal distribution is the familiar bell-shaped curve, centered at its mean.

00:00:14.138 --> 00:00:21.612
The standard deviation describes how spread out the values are. A z-score tells how

00:00:21.612 --> 00:00:26.114
many standard deviations a value is from the mean.

00:00:28.914 --> 00:00:35.741
For a normal distribution, about sixty-eight percent of values lie within one

00:00:35.741 --> 00:00:38.490
standard deviation of the mean.
